# How These Tools Support the Research

The tools listed above can be combined to create a safer agent architecture.

## Development Layer

Frameworks such as LangChain, LangGraph, and AutoGen can be used to create AI agents.

## Safety Layer

Guardrails AI and NeMo Guardrails can validate agent inputs, outputs, and actions.

## Evaluation Layer

OpenAI Evals and Inspect AI can be used to evaluate agent behavior before deployment.

## Research Environment

AI Safety Gridworlds provides controlled environments for studying reward hacking, unintended objectives, and safety failures.

