# Example Safety Architecture

A possible architecture using these tools is:

```text
User Objective
      ↓
Agent Framework
(LangGraph / LangChain)
      ↓
Objective Validation
      ↓
Safety Guardrails
      ↓
Risk Assessment
      ↓
Human Approval
(if required)
      ↓
Checkpoint
      ↓
Tool Execution
      ↓
Runtime Monitoring
      ↓
Unsafe Action Detected?
      │
 ┌────┴────┐
 │         │
No        Yes
 │         │
 ↓         ↓
Continue   Stop Execution
            ↓
         Rollback
            ↓
      Restore Safe State
```

